     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Possibility: se + imperfect subjunctive, present conditional",
     "texto": [
      "What would be possible if something happened: **Se avessi tempo, potremmo partire** (if I had time, we could leave).",
      "This is the type II already seen at B1, with the conditional of any verb."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Politeness with the conditional",
     "texto": [
      "**Vorremmo** (we would like), **accetterei** (I would accept), **mi trasferirei** (I would move).",
      "It is a polite way of saying what you would do."
